en truncated.\",\n          \"PROMPT_DATA_AND_RESPONSE_TRUNCATED\": \"The request has exceeded the max token size. Historical conversation context or additional prompt data may have been truncated. The response has exceeded your LLM's token limit and has been truncated.\",\n          \"COPILOT_ERROR\": \"There was an issue with your request. Please try again later or contact Bullhorn Support.\",\n          \"INCOMPLETE_COPILOT_CONFIG\": \"Required LLM configuration fields are missing. Please contact your Bullhorn Administrator.\",\n          \"INVALID_API_KEY\": \"LLM configuration is missing or incorrect. Please contact your Bullhorn Administrator.\",\n          \"INVALID_CONFIG_FIELDS\": \"LLM configuration is missing or incorrect. Please contact your Bullhorn Administrator.\",\n          \"INVALID_MODEL\": \"LLM configuration is missing or incorrect. Please contact your Bullhorn Administrator.\",\n          \"LLM_RATE_LIMIT_REACHED\": \"You have exceeded the usage limits of your LLM subscription. Please try again later or contact your Bullhorn Administrator.\",\n          \"TOKEN_LIMIT_REACHED\": \"This request has exceeded your token limit. Response may be truncated.\",\n          \"TOKEN_LIMIT_EXCEEDED\": \"This request has exceeded your token limit.\"\n        },\n        \"INFO\": {\n          \"CONTEXT_LIMIT\": \"In order to stay within the LLM token limit, this and any other responses will not include the full context from conversation.\",\n          \"COPIED_TO_CLIPBOARD\": {\n            \"TITLE\": \"Success!\",\n            \"MESSAGE\": \"Response copied to Clipboard.\"\n          }\n        },\n        \"NOT_CONFIGURED\": {\n          \"BODY\": \"Welcome to {productNameCopilot}. Please contact your administrator to complete the setup in order to use {productNameCopilot}.\",\n          \"TITLE\": \"{productNameCopilot} not configured\"\n        },\n        \"PLACEHOLDER\": {\n          \"SELECT_ENTITY\": \"Select a {entityTitle}\",\n          \"SELECT_DATA\": \"Select Data\",\n          \"TYPE_CUSTOM_PROMPT\": \"Type a custom prompt\",\n          \"USING\": \"using\"\n        },\n        \"PROMPT\": {\n          \"CUSTOM\": \"Custom Prompt\",\n          \"LENGTH\": {\n            \"CHANGE\": {\n              \"UNDER_100\": \"<100 words\",\n              \"UNDER_250\": \"<250 words\",\n              \"UNDER_500\": \"<500 words\"\n            },\n            \"UNDER_100\": \"Under 100 Words (Recommended for SMS)\",\n            \"UNDER_250\": \"Under 250 Words (Recommended for Email)\",\n            \"UNDER_500\": \"Under 500 Words\"\n          },\n          \"STANDARD\": {\n            \"CHECKIN_MESSAGE\": \"Draft a Check-in Message\",\n            \"CLIENT_PITCH\": \"Create a Client Pitch\",\n            \"IMPROVE_RESUME\": \"Improve {candidateName}'s {resume}\",\n            \"PITCH_JOB_TO_CANDIDATE\": \"Pitch {entityTitleJobOrder} to {candidateName}\",\n            \"REJECTION_MESSAGE\": \"Write a Rejection Message\",\n            \"SCREENING_QUESTIONS\": \"Create Screening Questions\",\n            \"SUMMARIZE_PROFILE\": \"Summarize {candidateName}'s Profile\",\n            \"EXTRACT_LAST_JOB_TITLE\": \"Extract Last Job Title from {entityTitleCandidate}\",\n            \"CREATE_PUBLIC_JOB_DESCRIPTION\": \"Create a Public {entityTitleJobOrder} Description\",\n            \"SCREENING_QUESTIONS_JOB\": \"Create Screening Questions\",\n            \"PITCH_CANDIDATE_FOR_JOB\": \"Pitch {entityTitleCandidate} for {entityTitleJobOrder}\",\n            \"IMPROVE_JOB_DESCRIPTION\": \"Improve {entityTitleJobOrder} Description\",\n            \"INTERVIEW_PREP\": \"Create Interview Prep Tips\",\n            \"ASK_ABOUT_HIRING_PLANS\": \"Ask {contactName} About Upcoming Hiring Plans\",\n            \"CLARIFY_JOB_REQUIREMENTS\": \"Clarify {entityTitleJobOrder} Requirements\",\n            \"PITCH_CANDIDATE_TO_CONTACT\": \"Pitch {entityTitleCandidate} to {contactName}\",\n            \"QUALIFY_JOB_REQUIREMENTS\": \"Qualify {entityTitleJobOrder} Requirements\"\n          },\n          \"TONE\": {\n            \"CASUAL\": \"Casual\",\n            \"NEUTRAL\": \"Neutral\",\n            \"BUSINESS\": \"Business\",\n            \"ACADEMIC\": \"Academic\",\n            \"FRIENDLY\": \"Friendly\",\n            \"PRECISE_FORMAL\": \"Precise and Formal\"\n          },\n          \"CREATIVITY\": {\n            \"LOW\": \"Precise - Consistent, factual responses. Best for job descriptions, candidate summaries, and data extraction.\",\n            \"MEDIUM\": \"Balanced - Mix of consistency and variety. Good for most use cases like outreach messages and interview questions.\",\n            \"HIGH\": \"Creative - Diverse, varied responses. Ideal for brainstorming, unique content, and exploring different angles.\"\n          },\n          \"PLACEHOLDERS\": {\n            \"CONVERSATION\": \"Tell {productNameCopilot} how to change the text, for example, \\\"Add a bullet pointed section about her experience\\\".\"\n          },\n          \"EXIT\": {\n            \"START_OVER_PRIMARY\": \"By starting over, you will lose your current conversation with {productNameCopilot}.\",\n            \"START_OVER_SECONDARY\": \"Are you sure you want to start over?\",\n            \"CLOSE_PRIMARY\": \"By closing the slideout, you will lose your current conversation with {productNameCopilot}.\",\n            \"CLOSE_SECONDARY\": \"Are you sure you want to close?\",\n            \"DO_NOT_SHOW\": \"Do not show this warning again\"\n          }\n        },\n        \"TIPS\": {\n          \"INSTRUCTIONS\": \"Select any desired data points and adjustments, then press generate.\",\n          \"LIMITATIONS\": {\n            \"BODY_1\": \"{productNameCopilot} runs on powerful technology but may still make mistakes, including occasionally generating incorrect information or producing harmful instructions or biased content.\",\n            \"BODY_2\": \"Ensure that you thoroughly review what it produces before using or publishing content.\",\n            \"TITLE\": \"Limitations\"\n          },\n          \"MEET_BULLHORN_COPILOT\": {\n            \"BODY\": \"{productNameCopilot} is Bullhorn's AI-powered digital assistant. Choose one of the prompts below to see how {productNameCopilot} can help you.\",\n            \"TITLE\": \"Meet Bullhorn {productNameCopilot}!\",\n            \"TIP\": \"{productNameCopilot} can make mistakes. Check for mistakes before using or publishing content.\"\n          }\n        }\n      },\n      \"DAY\": \"DAY\",\n      \"DAYS_IN_STATUS\": \"Days in Status\",\n      \"DEAL_VALUE\": \"Deal Value\",\n      \"DELETED_APPOINTMENT\": \"This appointment has been deleted.\",\n      \"DELETED_TASK\": \"This task has been deleted.\",\n      \"DETRACTORS\": \"Detractors\",\n      \"EMAIL_CONVERSATION_ACTIVITY\": \"Email Conversation Activity\",\n      \"EMAIL_CONVERSATION_ACTIVITY_EMPTY_TEXT\": \"You don't have any communication yet.<br/>Don't worry, this is automatically tracked and will be updated.\",\n      \"EMAIL_CONVERSATION_ACTIVITY_HELP_TEXT\": \"Click a date to view the most popular conversations at that time.\",\n      \"EMAIL_CONVERSATION_ACTIVITY_PERIOD_EMPTY_TEXT\": \"No email conversations during this period.\",\n      \"EMPTY_MESSAGE_EXTERNAL\": \"This {entityTitlePlacement} doesn't have any External Commissions.\",\n      \"EMPTY_MESSAGE_EXTERNAL_SUB\": \"Add External Commissions on the Commissions tab to see them here.\",\n      \"EMPTY_MESSAGE_INTERNAL\": \"This {entityTitlePlacement} doesn't have any Internal Commissions.\",\n      \"EMPTY_MESSAGE_INTERNAL_SUB\": \"Add Internal Commissions on the Commissions tab to see them here.\",\n      \"ENGAGED_CONTACTS\": \"Engaged Contacts\",\n      \"ENGAGEMENT_SUMMARY\": \"Engagement Summary Card\",\n      \"ENGAGEMENT_SUMMARY_HELP_TEXT\": \"Once you exchange emails, we will automatically let you know the best time to contact\",\n      \"EXPORT_STATUS\": {\n        \"TITLE\": \"Export Status\",\n        \"EXPORT