inue?\"\n  },\n  \"SEND_SMS\": {\n    \"TITLE\": \"Compose SMS Message\",\n    \"RECIPIENTS\": \"Recipients\",\n    \"MESSAGE\": \"Message\",\n    \"DISTRIBUTION_LIST\": \"Distribution List\",\n    \"CHARACTER_COUNT\": \"Character count\",\n    \"MESSAGE_LIMIT_ERROR\": \"Sorry, this message cannot exceed the maximum character count.\",\n    \"OPT_OUT\": \"\\\"To opt out reply STOP\\\" will appear at the end of your message.\",\n    \"DISTRIBUTION_LIST_HINT\": \"All opted-in members of selected distribution list(s) will receive the SMS message below.\",\n    \"SUCCESS\": \"Your message has been sent.\",\n    \"GENERIC_FAILURE\": \"Your message was not sent.\",\n    \"FAILURE\": \"Your message was not sent. All recipients have opted out.\",\n    \"PARTIAL_SUCCESS\": \"Your message has been sent to {Success} of {Total} recipients.\",\n    \"FAILURE_NO_PHONE\": {\n      \"1\": \"Your message was not sent. This recipient does not have a phone number.\",\n      \"many\": \"Your message was not sent. {quantity:number} of the selected recipients have no phone number.\"\n    },\n    \"SMS_USAGE\": \"Current Month's Text Message Usage\",\n    \"INVALID_NUMBER\": {\n      \"1\": \"Your message was not sent. This recipient does not have a valid phone number.\",\n      \"many\": \"Your message was not sent. The 'To' numbers {quantity:number} are not valid phone numbers.\"\n    },\n    \"NO_COUNTRY_CODE\": {\n      \"1\": \"Your message was not sent. This recipient's phone number does not have a supported country code.\",\n      \"many\": \"Your message was not sent. No Country Code could be found for the numbers: {quantity:number}. Supported country codes: [1].\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"RESUME\": {\n    \"EMPTY_MESSAGE_1\": \"Looks like this {entityTitle} doesn't have a {description}.\",\n    \"EMPTY_MESSAGE_2\": \"Paste it into the \",\n    \"EMPTY_MESSAGE_3\": \" field on the edit tab to see it here.\",\n    \"EXPAND\": \"Expand\",\n    \"NO_LINKED_CANDIDATE\": \"This {entityTitleClientContact} doesn't have a linked {entityTitleCandidate}.\"\n  },\n  \"PARSE_RESUME\": {\n    \"DESCRIPTION\": \"Looking to parse a resume? Simply drag and drop the file anywhere on this page, or copy and paste the text below.\",\n    \"PARSE_INTO_FORM\": \"Would you like to parse this resume into the form below?\",\n    \"FAILURE\": \"Oops! Something went wrong. The resume was not parsed.\",\n    \"DUPLICATE_MODAL_TITLE\": \"Potential Duplicates Found\",\n    \"DUPLICATE_MODAL_FOOTER_BUTTON\": \"Continue\",\n    \"NO\": \"No\",\n    \"YES\": \"Yes\",\n    \"DISPLAY_TOOLBOX\": \"Display Toolbox\",\n    \"NOT_RECOGNIZED\": \"No parsed file was recognized. Please select and confirm the file that you want to display.\"\n  },\n  \"GDPR_COMPLIANCE\": {\n    \"CONFIRM\": \"Confirm\",\n    \"LEARN_MORE\": \"Learn More\",\n    \"FIELD_MAPS\": \"Field Maps\",\n    \"TOAST_MESSAGE\": \"Please confirm that your Field Maps are properly configured for GDPR by making sure that any sensitive data is properly stored.\",\n    \"SUCCESS_TOAST\": \"Your confirmation has been successfully recorded.\",\n    \"FAILURE_TOAST\": \"Confirmation unsuccessful. Please refresh your page and try again.\",\n    \"CANNOT_ERASE_RECORD\": \"Cannot erase {entityLabel} data due to active or past billing.\",\n    \"WARNING_HEADER\": \"Mass Erase\",\n    \"WARNING_CONTENT\": \"Are you sure you want to erase all sensitive data?\",\n    \"WARNING_CONTENT_MIXED\": \"Only {validIds} {entityLabelMany} will have their data deleted. The remaining {invalidIds} cannot be erased due to active or past billing.\"\n  },\n  \"CCPA_COMPLIANCE\": {\n    \"DATA_CAPTURE_NOTIFICATION_SENT\": \"Data capture notification email has been sent and note added.\",\n    \"DATA_CAPTURE_NOTIFICATION_EMAIL_INVALID\": \"Data capture notification cannot be sent since this record does not have a valid email address.\",\n    \"DATA_CAPTURE_NOTIFICATION_EMAIL_BODY_ERROR\": \"Looks like your data capture notification email body isn't configured yet. Your administrator will need to set this up in System Settings before you can send a data capture notification.\",\n    \"DATA_CAPTURE_NOTIFICATION_EMAIL_SUBJECT_LINE_ERROR\": \"Looks like your data capture notification email subject line isn't configured yet. Your administrator will need to set this up in System Settings before you can send a data capture notification.\",\n    \"DATA_CAPTURE_NOTIFICATION_NOTE_TYPE_ERROR\": \"Looks like your data capture notification note type isn't configured yet. Your administrator will need to set this up in System Settings before you can send a data capture notification.\"\n  },\n  \"REMOVE_FROM_TEARSHEET\": {\n    \"WARNING_LABEL\": {\n      \"other\": {\n        \"1\": \"Are you sure you want to remove this {entityTitle} from {Tearsheet}?\",\n        \"many\": \"Are you sure you want to remove these {entityTitlePlural} from {Tearsheet}?\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"SUCCESS\": {\n      \"other\": {\n        \"1\": \"1 {entityTitle} has been successfully removed from {Tearsheet}\",\n        \"many\": \"{quantity:number} {entityTitlePlural} have been successfully removed from {Tearsheet}\"\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  \"ADD_INTERNAL_SUBMISSION\": {\n    \"SAVED_MESSAGE\": {\n      \"other\": {\n        \"1\": \"{entityTitleCandidate} has been successfully submitted.\",\n        \"many\": \"{quantity:number} {entityTitleCandidateMany} have been successfully submitted.\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"NOT_ADDED\": {\n      \"other\": {\n        \"1\": \"This {entityTitleJobSubmission} was a duplicate and was not added.\",\n        \"many\": \"All {entityTitleJobSubmissionMany} were duplicates and were not added.\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"PARTIALLY_ADDED\": \"{numAdded} of {total} {entityTitleJobSubmissionMany} successfully created. Duplicate {entityTitleJobSubmissionMany} were not added.\",\n    \"EDIT_SUCCESS\": \"This {entityTitleJobSubmission} has been successfully updated.\",\n    \"NEXT_ACTION\": {\n      \"NONE\": \"None\",\n 